    "The amount shown on this milestone is a live preview of what you'd gain if you went offline right now. It reads **(Inactive)** when the conditions below aren't currently met — so closing the game in your current state would gain nothing from this milestone." : {

    },
    "The Automator allows (amongst other things) buying full Time Study Trees, entering Eternity Challenges, or starting Dilation." : {

    },
    "The Automator is split into two halves: the left side contains your script and execution controls, and the right side contains documentation, script management, and error information." : {

    },
    "The Automator runs commands at a rate that increases with your Reality count, up to a maximum of 1,000 commands per real-time second." : {

    },
    "The Automator uses a custom scripting language to perform game actions for you. Use the %@ tab to see all available commands. You can also define constants as shorthand names for values." : {

    },
